keel-overlay-vip (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First release: the units of keel's service VIP on the WireGuard mesh
    (handbook decision 0049, third round). keel-vip.service runs keel vip
    tend, the root helper, with CAP_NET_ADMIN alone, AF_UNIX and
    AF_NETLINK only, writing only /var/lib/keel/vip and /etc/wireguard;
    it starts the controller as a transient unit with a dynamic user and
    no capability, and drops every VIP the node carries once it stops;
    StartLimitIntervalSec=0, so a crash loop never leaves it stopped for
    good; installed disabled.
    keel-vip-check.timer runs keel vip check at boot and every minute.

